    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zdrav\u00edm v\u0161echny hr\u00e1\u010de, kte\u0159\u00ed sem zav\u00edtali b\u011bhem \u201e<strong>CZ &amp; SK Games Week 2024</strong>\u201c. Vyzkou\u0161et si zde m\u016f\u017eete <strong>demo </strong>hry. Demo m\u00e1 zat\u00edm hotovou hlavn\u00ed mechaniku, tj. <strong>fyziku hlavn\u00ed postavy</strong>. Na grafice, zvuc\u00edch, \u00farovn\u00edch atd. <strong>budu pracovat</strong>. Pln\u00e1 hra by m\u011bla m\u00edt i achievementy a \u017eeb\u0159\u00ed\u010dky. Budu r\u00e1d za ka\u017ed\u00fd <strong>wishlist</strong> a hlavn\u011b odezvu v <strong>komunitn\u00edm centru</strong>.\u00a0Super bude, kdy\u017e zas\u00eddl\u00edte <strong>video</strong> nebo <strong>screenshot</strong> z va\u0161eho hran\u00ed.  Pokud naraz\u00edte na <strong>chybu</strong> napi\u0161te zde do <strong>diskuze</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">D\u011bkuju.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Parkour bot - 5 best game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1)</strong> Unique playable character = Unique game experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2)</strong> Physics based levels = Lots of unexpected events &amp; more fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3)</strong> Diverse enemies = New challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4)</strong> Less talking = More playing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5)</strong> A lot of achievements = Speedrunners are welcome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast paced rhythm based physics platform game, with an unique movement set of main character and dynamic levels. No story, just your skill. So what are you waiting for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054190/extras/b57af3392d024da6f1a4092dcec07eca.poster.avif?t=1748289714\" ><source src=\"https://sha